; t09 weave: non-fanout DAG, multi-input tasks, fanout with broadcast input
; 1. plain DAG, multi-input task
weave
  task a 1 2 add endt
  task b 10 20 add endt
  a b task c add endt
wrun
print

; 2. fanout: first input drives, second input broadcast
weave
  task items 1 6 range endt
  task base 100 endt
  items base 4 task work add endt
wrun
results!
results@ len print
results@ sort results!
results@ 0 get print
results@ 4 get print
